1
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,120
Manzhi.

2
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:19,280
Honey.

3
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:23,010
[Six months ago]

4
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,100
I shouldn't have done that.

5
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,280
Open the door and let's talk.

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,600
Okay?

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,760
Manzhi,

8
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,180
why is it

9
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:33,000
so hard for the two of us to even sit down

10
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,790
and talk calmly now?

11
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,600
When we first met,

12
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,750
we were at a casino.

13
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,650
You told me to follow your bets,

14
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:42,910
and we

15
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:45,770
won 17 rounds in a row.
Have you forgotten?

16
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,030
Back then, you said

17
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:51,420
I was the most daring man you'd ever seen.

18
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:55,250
And I said you were my lucky goddess.

19
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:56,300
Have you forgotten all that?

20
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,880
Tang Yushan, Tang Yushan,

21
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,840
I'm begging you.

22
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,240
Please let me go.

23
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,030
I'm begging you.

24
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,840
Can you just let me go?

25
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:03,920
You're begging me?

26
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:05,160
You're my wife,

27
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:06,470
and you're begging me?

28
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:07,760
Haven't I been good to you?

29
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,950
If others heard this,

30
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:11,680
they'd think I was a despicable man!

31
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,560
Manzhi,

32
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,789
open the door! Open the door!

33
00:01:14,789 --> 00:01:17,250
I'm so good to you,
and you want to divorce me?

34
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:19,240
Tang Yushan, you don't love me at all!

35
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,570
Open it!

36
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,440
Open the door!

37
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,789
Open the door!

38
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:25,120
Open the door!

39
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,640
Open the door!

40
00:01:29,590 --> 00:01:31,120
What's with all the ruckus?

41
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,890
Open the door right now!

42
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,570
Director Fan.

43
00:01:52,229 --> 00:01:53,000
Director Fan,

44
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,930
what a rare honor

45
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,350
to have you here today.

46
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,070
Mr. Tang,

47
00:01:56,229 --> 00:01:58,870
my men received a complaint

48
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,760
about a lot of noise
coming from your house.

49
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,070
When I heard it was about you,

50
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:05,000
I decided to come over personally.

51
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,560
Are you moving,

52
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,950
or throwing a party?

53
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:10,560
Fan,

54
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,400
we go way back,

55
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,030
so I won't hide it from you.

56
00:02:14,490 --> 00:02:16,840
Every family has its own troubles.

57
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:18,280
My wife

58
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,840
is an actress. You know that.

59
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,360
Lately, those reporters are always

60
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,400
looking for something to write about.

61
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,000
She's under a lot of stress
and has been losing her temper.

62
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,910
See?

63
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:27,190
There's nothing I can do about it.

64
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:28,320
Please bear with us.

65
00:02:30,730 --> 00:02:34,320
Your wife has quite a bit of strength.

66
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,750
Give me a second.

67
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:42,510
Director Fan,

68
00:02:42,710 --> 00:02:43,680
I'm really sorry

69
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,190
for disturbing the neighbors

70
00:02:45,190 --> 00:02:46,750
and making you and your men
come all the way here

71
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:48,470
so late at night.

72
00:02:48,490 --> 00:02:50,840
Let's play cards together sometime.

73
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:53,660
Sure thing.

74
00:02:59,090 --> 00:02:59,970
Director Fan.

75
00:03:02,950 --> 00:03:05,230
Could I trouble your men to help me

76
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:06,850
with one more small matter?

77
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:38,840
[A Prophet]

78
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:41,900
[Episode 17]

79
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:44,560
Second Brother,

80
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,870
Shangguan Chengming didn't care

81
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:49,110
about your beloved treasure at all.

82
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,630
He smashed it without a second thought.

83
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:53,070
And the woman you love

84
00:05:53,510 --> 00:05:55,360
has eyes only for him.

85
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,010
I really feel sorry for you.

86
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,650
You came all the way here

87
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,300
in the middle of the night

88
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:05,700
just to rub salt in my wounds?

89
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,130
A couple of days ago,

90
00:06:08,990 --> 00:06:10,590
I ran into a drunkard.

91
00:06:10,990 --> 00:06:13,720
He shouted at Shangguan Chengming...

92
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:14,860
Wang Jiaxian!

93
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,870
Why are you here?

94
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:20,360
If we can prove

95
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,360
that he isn't Shangguan Chengming,

96
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:23,870
wouldn't that settle

97
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:25,730
both the Sect Master's matter

98
00:06:25,750 --> 00:06:27,190
and yours?

99
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,070
That's him!

100
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:38,290
What are you doing?

101
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:40,020
You're Yang Xiaozhong, right?

102
00:06:40,450 --> 00:06:41,200
Yes.

103
00:06:41,230 --> 00:06:42,330
We've received a report

104
00:06:42,330 --> 00:06:44,200
that you're involved in a fraud case.

105
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,280
Come with us.

106
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,070
Officers, you must have the wrong person.

107
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:47,720
No.

108
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,240
Move!

109
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,390
Are you just going to arrest me

110
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:51,159
in broad daylight like this?

111
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:52,560
Is there no law anymore?

112
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,430
Cut the crap!

113
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,040
Move!

114
00:06:58,950 --> 00:06:59,560
Hello.

115
00:06:59,870 --> 00:07:00,360
Hello.

116
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,250
I'm looking for Mr. Yang Xiaozhong.

117
00:07:02,250 --> 00:07:03,970
Could you tell me which room he's in?

118
00:07:03,970 --> 00:07:06,410
He must've committed a serious crime.

119
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:09,440
The police just took him away
with a hood over his head.

120
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,160
Thank you.

121
00:07:16,670 --> 00:07:18,040
It definitely wasn't the police.

122
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,040
Of course.

123
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:21,850
How would the police
put a hood over a suspect's head?

124
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:22,760
They did it

125
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:25,800
so he wouldn't know
where he was being taken.

126
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:30,240
Who else do you think

127
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:32,990
would be interested in
Yang Xiaozhong right now?

128
00:07:50,250 --> 00:07:51,580
Do you know this person?

129
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,950
According to our investigation,

130
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:58,240
this man is part of a fraud ring.

131
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,920
He scammed a high-ranking official
out of over 100 gold bars.

132
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,310
Are you his accomplice?

133
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,600
No.

134
00:08:04,270 --> 00:08:05,310
Bullshit.

135
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:06,870
Someone saw

136
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:08,200
you with him last night.

137
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,330
Here's the deal.

138
00:08:09,330 --> 00:08:10,590
I'll give you a choice.

139
00:08:10,610 --> 00:08:13,490
Do you want to be a suspect

140
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,360
or a witness?

141
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:17,430
Tell me.

142
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,240
What's his name?

143
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,920
Remember,

144
00:08:21,990 --> 00:08:23,330
I'm Shangguan Chengming.

145
00:08:23,330 --> 00:08:25,370
And we didn't know each other before,

146
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:26,280
got it?

147
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,220
His name is Shangguan Chengming.

148
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,690
Shangguan Chengming?

149
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:35,320
Shangguan...

150
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:38,000
that's a pretty rare surname, isn't it?

151
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,360
Is it his real name?

152
00:08:39,710 --> 00:08:41,159
Yes,

153
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,450
it's his real name.

154
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,750
Looks like you still
don't want to tell the truth.

155
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:46,840
Listen up,

156
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:49,300
this guy's underlings
have already confessed.

157
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,490
It's on you now.

158
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,710
Think about it.

159
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,200
Ten years in prison.

160
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,460
Delicate and soft as you are,

161
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:56,740
could you really survive in there?

162
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:10,550
I really don't know him.

163
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:13,720
I only know
his name is Shangguan Chengming.

164
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,750
Really.

165
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,670
How did you guys meet?

166
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,850
F-Fortune telling.

167
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,720
Fortune telling.

168
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:23,870
In our line of work, we believe in that.

169
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,870
Whether a film will be a hit

170
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,790
doesn't depend on the script

171
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,630
but on what the fortune tellers say.

172
00:09:33,610 --> 00:09:34,600
Why do I feel like

173
00:09:34,630 --> 00:09:37,160
this director is
actually telling the truth?

174
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:39,020
Don't tell me...

175
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:42,060
you've dragged me into this.

176
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:45,030
What's in it for me?

177
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:48,960
Second Brother,

178
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:50,340
time to get rough.

179
00:09:58,050 --> 00:09:58,930
Tell us!

180
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,120
Still not telling the truth, huh?

181
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,120
I don't know...

182
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:10,250
Speak!

183
00:10:17,530 --> 00:10:18,860
Enough, enough.

184
00:10:18,890 --> 00:10:20,530
Don't actually kill him.

185
00:10:24,750 --> 00:10:25,510
Boss,

186
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:26,630
how about

187
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,860
we feed him some steamed buns?

188
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,660
Steamed buns with cold water.

189
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:33,400
Good idea.

190
00:10:33,430 --> 00:10:34,280
On it!

191
00:10:40,130 --> 00:10:40,970
A steamed bun.

192
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:42,250
Isn't it great?

193
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:43,870
Eat up.

194
00:10:44,670 --> 00:10:46,200
Must I feed you myself?

195
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:52,120
Eat! Eat!

196
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,160
Director Yang,

197
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:57,000
your industry is associated with

198
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,630
the Fire element.

199
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,760
That's exactly

200
00:11:00,890 --> 00:11:04,010
where so many films flop—
chasing the heat too hard.

201
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,030
Yes.

202
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,510
Sir, you're quite an expert.

203
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,240
Hardly.

204
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,550
I just know a thing or two.

205
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:11,200
But...

206
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,730
we're just discussing, right?

207
00:11:14,550 --> 00:11:15,550
I think

208
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:16,750
a good director

209
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:19,530
should at least know
when to push and when to ease off.

210
00:11:19,530 --> 00:11:21,590
Stacking hit after hit is dangerous.

211
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,790
You need at least one

212
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,790
you go all-in on,

213
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:26,200
and one you ease off on,

214
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,240
right?

215
00:11:30,250 --> 00:11:32,650
Having enough
is better than having it all.

216
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:34,790
Spot on.

217
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:46,390
Here we are.

218
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,080
Sir,

219
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,590
I... can leave now?

220
00:11:52,930 --> 00:11:54,010
Can I?

221
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:55,320
Sure.

222
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,440
Come on.

223
00:12:03,210 --> 00:12:04,940
Director Yang? Director Yang.

224
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,630
This way.

225
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:07,510
Let me see you out.

226
00:12:07,510 --> 00:12:07,910
Let's go.

227
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:08,440
Sir.

228
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:09,510
No need.

229
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:10,720
I...

230
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,150
Don't mention it.

231
00:12:12,630 --> 00:12:13,150
Sir.

232
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,030
I've told you

233
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:16,960
everything I know.

234
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:17,910
Yes.

235
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,550
I know.

236
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,150
Listen,

237
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:20,840
calm down.

238
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,510
I know!

239
00:12:23,270 --> 00:12:24,130
Director Yang.

240
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:24,800
Sir.

241
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:27,000
Let's get things straight first.

242
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,720
Every debt has its debtor.

243
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,550
When you get down there,

244
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:31,000
you should know exactly

245
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,960
who to go after.

246
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:37,600
Sir...

247
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,460
Director Yang,

248
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:39,910
may you rest in peace.

249
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:48,880
Sir...

250
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:50,670
Sir!

251
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,200
Sir!

252
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,200
I'll confess!

253
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,410
-I'll tell you everything!
-Stop.

254
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:07,200
It must've been Master Swindler

255
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,800
who put Second Batou up to it.

256
00:13:09,910 --> 00:13:10,790
How do you know?

257
00:13:11,630 --> 00:13:12,780
Master Swindler

258
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:14,810
has always been
the Sect Master's designated successor,

259
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:16,710
in charge of
maintaining order within the sect.

260
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:18,640
But he's the most unruly one.

261
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:21,360
He sure fooled the Sect Master.

262
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,120
You really think
the Sect Master can't see through him?

263
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,600
He's just old,

264
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:27,120
not senile.

265
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:29,500
He simply chooses not to call him out.

266
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:31,080
True.

267
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:34,250
Who could hide anything
from the Sect Master?

268
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,750
Not necessarily.

269
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,900
Some people have managed to
fool him, right?

270
00:13:40,030 --> 00:13:41,360
A person can be deceived

271
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:43,320
because deep down,

272
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,720
they want to be deceived.

273
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,900
Who are you two talking about?

274
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:50,670
You.

275
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,240
They've left.

276
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,480
Not me, right?

277
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:01,270
Quiet.

278
00:14:07,310 --> 00:14:08,310
Get down here.

279
00:14:10,860 --> 00:14:11,780
They bought it?

280
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:14,910
Anyway,

281
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,240
I said what was written on that bun.

282
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,510
Must I feed you myself?

283
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:20,510
Look carefully!

284
00:14:20,530 --> 00:14:21,410
This is a bun!

285
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:24,060
[Insist that Tang Yushan
knows Shangguan Chengming.]

286
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:28,900
Eat! Eat!

287
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:48,840
How was it?

288
00:14:49,770 --> 00:14:51,570
More thrilling than making movies, right?

289
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,450
Making movies only costs money.

290
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:56,570
Your line of work costs lives.

291
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:58,960
Let's go.

292
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,650
Ever since I entered this business,
I've been

293
00:15:04,650 --> 00:15:07,080
working hard in pursuit of
my beautiful artistic ideals.

294
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:09,740
But you people trample on my soul
with your money

295
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:12,320
and use your power to force me to submit.

296
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,320
I'm telling you,

297
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,320
I will never agree.

298
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:19,520
This is the unfinished half of the movie

299
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,880
that Tang talked about.

300
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,120
It's my fault too.

301
00:15:22,870 --> 00:15:25,200
After the publicity and buzz
we got from that cemetery stunt,

302
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,960
he now wants me to finish this movie.

303
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,670
Does he still have money to make a movie?

304
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:30,390
Actually, he's never had much money.

305
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:31,600
But this guy really is an expert

306
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:33,440
at getting something for nothing.

307
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,750
He fools investors

308
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:36,870
while borrowing from loan sharks.

309
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:39,120
Then why don't we come at it
from this angle

310
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,510
and make him unable to repay his debts?

311
00:15:40,510 --> 00:15:41,550
How do you usually

312
00:15:42,270 --> 00:15:43,790
choose actresses for your movies?

313
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,630
That's quite complicated.

314
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,120
Say...

315
00:15:47,510 --> 00:15:48,480
I'm the director.

316
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,720
Then I certainly have the power
to recommend someone.

317
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,630
The investors
have considerable sway as well.

318
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:52,910
Sometimes they insist

319
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:54,770
that you use a particular person.

320
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,240
Don't forget,

321
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,390
the employment contract
you signed with the company

322
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:02,520
states clearly that

323
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:04,690
if the company suffers losses

324
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:07,000
for personal reasons...

325
00:16:07,490 --> 00:16:08,570
Listen up,

326
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,330
I'm giving you two choices now.

327
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:12,550
Either sign this agreement

328
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:14,740
or pay compensation and leave!

329
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:20,390
I will make this movie...

330
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:22,880
a huge hit.

331
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:27,260
Tang Yushan is a compulsive gambler.

332
00:16:28,090 --> 00:16:30,150
Only gambling can get his attention.

333
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:33,010
What does a gambler need the most?

334
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,270
Money.

335
00:16:35,990 --> 00:16:38,120
He was desperately pursuing He Manzhi

336
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,510
because she was rich.

337
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,360
Living off a woman

338
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:44,750
is his greatest ambition.

339
00:16:51,870 --> 00:16:53,080
Let's go, cousin.

340
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,320
Let's go dance.

341
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:58,320
Oh my God.

342
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,080
I'm sorry.

343
00:16:59,150 --> 00:16:59,960
Are you blind?

344
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:00,600
I'm really sorry.

345
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,390
Do you know how expensive this dress is?

346
00:17:02,390 --> 00:17:03,920
Can you afford to pay for it?

347
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,270
Forget it.

348
00:17:05,270 --> 00:17:05,589
Let's go.

349
00:17:05,589 --> 00:17:06,119
Let's go.

350
00:17:07,109 --> 00:17:08,240
Chief Editor Zheng!

351
00:17:09,030 --> 00:17:10,000
Mr. Tang?

352
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,069
It really is you.

353
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,400
Some friend you are.

354
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:16,900
Going out for drinks
and not even asking me along?

355
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:17,940
And who is this?

356
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:19,700
Mr. Tang, let me introduce you.

357
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:22,130
This is my cousin, Jiang Manyu.

358
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:23,680
Nice to meet you, Miss Manyu.

359
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,829
I'm Tang Yushan.

360
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,109
Cousin,

361
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,310
I came all the way back from overseas

362
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,349
just to avoid all the social engagements

363
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:29,950
my dad keeps setting up for me.

364
00:17:29,950 --> 00:17:31,590
And now here I am,
dealing with the same old song and dance.

365
00:17:31,590 --> 00:17:33,250
You brought me out for drinks,

366
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,350
and I have to deal with this nobody?

367
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,270
Miss Manyu,

368
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:38,000
you don't like drinking?

369
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,000
It's alright.

370
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,440
I drink a little sometimes.

371
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,790
Any other hobbies?

372
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,440
I like...

373
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,760
looking at beautiful women.

374
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:51,800
Miss Manyu, you certainly have
an unusual hobby.

375
00:17:52,030 --> 00:17:53,680
Well, cousin,

376
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,070
when that beauty walks down the stairs,

377
00:17:56,070 --> 00:17:57,590
how many men
do you think will turn to look?

378
00:17:57,590 --> 00:17:58,880
I'd say...

379
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,440
3.

380
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,750
Three?

381
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,950
Men really don't understand men.

382
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:05,080
Then what's your guess?

383
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:06,170
If you ask me,

384
00:18:06,610 --> 00:18:07,770
at least 6.

385
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:10,160
How about we make a bet?

386
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,960
Sure.

387
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,000
Mr. Tang?

388
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:14,240
Then I'll join the fun too.

389
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:17,350
That "at least" of yours
was very well put.

390
00:18:17,350 --> 00:18:19,310
I bet at least 8.

391
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,310
One,

392
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,350
two,

393
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:26,170
three, four, five...

394
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,070
Six.

395
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,550
Seven.

396
00:18:33,150 --> 00:18:34,390
Eight.

397
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,570
Nine.

398
00:18:36,310 --> 00:18:37,550
Ten.

399
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,590
Eleven.

400
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:41,960
You win.

401
00:18:42,110 --> 00:18:42,880
Here you go.

402
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,490
It's not much money anyway.

403
00:18:46,510 --> 00:18:47,350
Waiter!

404
00:18:48,050 --> 00:18:48,960
Yes, sir.

405
00:18:49,370 --> 00:18:51,480
I'm in a particularly good mood today.

406
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,200
So I'm buying a drink for

407
00:18:53,220 --> 00:18:55,330
every guest here tonight.

408
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:56,440
Certainly, sir.

409
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,720
Great!

410
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:02,830
Oh, this is bad.

411
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:04,880
I'm out of money for drinks.

412
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,440
Miss Manyu,

413
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,590
could you buy me a drink?

414
00:19:08,590 --> 00:19:09,880
It would be my honor.

415
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,510
Cousin,

416
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:17,640
this friend of yours is quite interesting.

417
00:19:19,350 --> 00:19:20,030
Please.

418
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:22,790
Miss Manyu,

419
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:24,270
how long do you plan to stay this time?

420
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:25,000
I don't know.

421
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,840
My cousin is busy from morning till night,

422
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:28,390
and my parents don't even know I'm back.

423
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:29,810
There's no one to hang out with.

424
00:19:29,810 --> 00:19:30,770
So boring.

425
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:31,920
Your father

426
00:19:32,110 --> 00:19:34,070
must be quite strict with you.

427
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,440
He just wants what's best for you.

428
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,680
Don't mention him.

429
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:39,030
He's always surrounded by a crowd,

430
00:19:39,030 --> 00:19:40,350
and he lectures me all the time.

431
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:42,680
He really thinks
everyone is his subordinate.

432
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:43,640
Well, men

433
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,720
sometimes

434
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,740
can't balance career and family.

435
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,050
It's understandable.

436
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:50,350
May I ask what your father does?

437
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:54,640
He's just a lousy bank president.

438
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,340
What's so great about him?

439
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:58,030
Miss Manyu,

440
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:01,440
I have a presumptuous request.

441
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,480
What is it?

442
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,850
Let me formally introduce myself.

443
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:08,890
I'm Tang Yushan,

444
00:20:08,890 --> 00:20:11,150
General Manager of Changfeng Pictures.

445
00:20:13,070 --> 00:20:14,070
Movie...

446
00:20:14,230 --> 00:20:16,840
My company is currently casting

447
00:20:16,990 --> 00:20:18,390
a female lead for a movie.

448
00:20:18,510 --> 00:20:20,310
In my mind,

449
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:21,880
she should be

450
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,920
beautiful, elegant,

451
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:27,270
well-mannered, and gentle.

452
00:20:27,290 --> 00:20:29,600
And above all, she should have

453
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:33,350
that independent, free spirit
and the strength that comes with it.

454
00:20:33,350 --> 00:20:35,480
To be honest, it's really hard to find.

455
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,080
I was almost ready to give up.

456
00:20:37,350 --> 00:20:38,920
Until I saw you just now.

457
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,160
You know, in that instant,

458
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:42,160
I...

459
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,960
Acting in a movie, right?

460
00:20:45,270 --> 00:20:47,750
That sounds quite interesting.

461
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:49,440
I'm kind of interested.

462
00:20:49,550 --> 00:20:51,310
But Mr. Tang,

463
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:53,510
who would I be acting with?

464
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:54,920
He Manzhi.

465
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,440
He Man...

466
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:57,830
He Manzhi?

467
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:58,960
Oh my God.

468
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,440
Didn't He Manzhi

469
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,880
die recently?

470
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:03,720
Yes.

471
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:05,590
Suicide.

472
00:21:06,310 --> 00:21:07,970
I don't want to hide anything.

473
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,270
She was my wife.

474
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,030
And this movie

475
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:13,030
was also her last, unfinished work.

476
00:21:13,860 --> 00:21:15,420
I must find someone,

477
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:18,160
someone who can truly take her place,

478
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,790
to fulfill her wish.

479
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,750
Can you do it?

480
00:21:22,510 --> 00:21:23,680
He Manzhi...

481
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:26,200
But...

482
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:27,960
can I really do it?

483
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,240
Manyu.

484
00:21:38,750 --> 00:21:39,790
Look at her.

485
00:21:40,290 --> 00:21:41,620
She's so radiant.

486
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:45,550
Manyu, have you ever thought about this?

487
00:21:45,550 --> 00:21:46,880
Imagine one day

488
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:48,940
your arrogant father

489
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:50,150
is walking down the street

490
00:21:50,150 --> 00:21:52,500
and passes a giant movie poster.

491
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:56,030
And when he looks up at it,

492
00:21:56,830 --> 00:21:58,830
he finds that the person on it is you.

493
00:21:58,830 --> 00:22:00,400
How would that feel?

494
00:22:01,590 --> 00:22:02,790
Have you imagined it?

495
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:05,200
If you star in this movie,

496
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,160
you're not just

497
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:08,270
taking over He Manzhi's role

498
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:11,200
but also her status as a superstar.

499
00:22:13,110 --> 00:22:14,570
A chance to turn the tables

500
00:22:15,310 --> 00:22:16,790
doesn't come to everyone.

501
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:46,310
Okay.

502
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,830
There are a lot of people
auditioning today.

503
00:22:49,830 --> 00:22:51,030
So everyone,
let's make the most of our time.

504
00:22:51,030 --> 00:22:52,030
Okay.

505
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:52,880
Alright.

506
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,070
Action.

507
00:22:57,750 --> 00:23:00,510
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

508
00:23:00,510 --> 00:23:03,070
But I know that isn't the real me.

509
00:23:04,030 --> 00:23:06,880
But I know this isn't the real me.

510
00:23:06,900 --> 00:23:08,970
It's only the me they want to see.

511
00:23:09,180 --> 00:23:12,630
The saddest thing in the world is

512
00:23:12,650 --> 00:23:14,400
not even being able to tell for yourself

513
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:17,710
if you're acting or living.

514
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:19,080
Maybe...

515
00:23:19,110 --> 00:23:20,110
Have you been here before?

516
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:21,790
I've long since become

517
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:24,310
the most successful role I've ever played!

518
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:24,960
Hello, Mr. Tang.

519
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,960
Good work, everyone.

520
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:27,750
Hello, Mr. Tang.

521
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,400
Good work, everyone.

522
00:23:31,030 --> 00:23:31,550
How's it going?

523
00:23:31,550 --> 00:23:32,830
Is the audition going well today?

524
00:23:32,830 --> 00:23:34,760
Not bad. We're still working on it.

525
00:23:35,010 --> 00:23:35,780
Mr. Tang,

526
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,200
who is this?

527
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:39,230
Let me make a proper introduction.

528
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:40,310
This is Miss Manyu,

529
00:23:40,310 --> 00:23:41,260
my friend.

530
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,160
I brought her here today

531
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:43,930
mainly so she could get a feel...

532
00:23:43,930 --> 00:23:46,010
a feel for the atmosphere here.

533
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,090
This is my team.

534
00:23:47,110 --> 00:23:47,980
Man...

535
00:23:48,030 --> 00:23:49,270
Manyu, right?

536
00:23:49,270 --> 00:23:50,550
Hello, I'm the director of this movie.

537
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:51,610
My name is Yang Xiaozhong.

538
00:23:51,610 --> 00:23:52,690
Manyu.

539
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:55,560
Actually, I'd still like you
to do an audition.

540
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,310
I have to audition?

541
00:23:58,310 --> 00:23:59,350
Of course.

542
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:01,710
You'll do this one scene in a bit.

543
00:24:01,810 --> 00:24:02,810
Don't be nervous.

544
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:04,840
Just go with your own feelings

545
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,920
and say these lines, okay?

546
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:07,960
I can't.

547
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:09,590
Um...

548
00:24:10,510 --> 00:24:11,370
You, step down.

549
00:24:11,750 --> 00:24:12,200
Step down.

550
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:12,920
Right now?

551
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,110
Of course, now. Come on.

552
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:15,030
Please don't make me do this.

553
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:15,830
I say you can, so you can.

554
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:16,550
Come on.

555
00:24:17,270 --> 00:24:18,270
I'm not doing it. It's too much trouble.

556
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,160
Go away.

557
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:21,200
Mr. Tang.

558
00:24:21,590 --> 00:24:23,110
So many people are watching.

559
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:24,070
I feel quite embarrassed.

560
00:24:24,070 --> 00:24:25,550
What's there to be embarrassed about?

561
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:26,510
Trust me.

562
00:24:31,110 --> 00:24:31,970
Take your time.

563
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,260
Prepare yourself.

564
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:36,880
Look how beautiful I am

565
00:24:37,270 --> 00:24:38,350
in the mirror.

566
00:24:38,370 --> 00:24:39,420
Look how beautiful I am...

567
00:24:39,420 --> 00:24:40,310
Manyu.

568
00:24:41,590 --> 00:24:42,440
You need to

569
00:24:43,070 --> 00:24:45,160
let these lines sink into your heart.

570
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:47,310
Treat the stage as your home

571
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,590
and enjoy it.

572
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,450
Understand?

573
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,640
Got it.

574
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:54,440
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

575
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:57,400
Look how beautiful I am in the mirror.

576
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:59,070
Does she look the part?

577
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:01,270
Yes, very much so.

578
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:03,040
Director, what do you think?

579
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:04,240
I think...

580
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,550
her age...

581
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,720
She's younger.

582
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:10,330
She looks like a younger He Manzhi.

583
00:25:10,350 --> 00:25:11,410
Don't you think so?

584
00:25:12,030 --> 00:25:15,000
Mr. Tang, her potential
is absolutely incredible.

585
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:18,400
Of course. You think she's
some country bumpkin like you?

586
00:25:18,550 --> 00:25:20,440
Her father is a banker.

587
00:25:20,550 --> 00:25:21,400
She just returned from studying abroad

588
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,350
in America.

589
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,240
Got it?

590
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,070
Uh...

591
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:25,920
Have you acted before?

592
00:25:26,030 --> 00:25:27,550
No, Director.

593
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:29,720
Having no acting experience is the best.

594
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,920
What we need is a blank slate.

595
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,000
Why all the questions?

596
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:33,480
If she already had acting experience,

597
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,750
why would I need you as a director?

598
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:37,140
Shoot 10 takes,
and one of them will be usable.

599
00:25:37,140 --> 00:25:38,340
You guys, step aside.

600
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:39,790
Step aside.

601
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:43,550
Look how beautiful I am in this mirror.

602
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,200
Look how beautiful...

603
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:50,920
-Okay?
-Okay.

604
00:25:51,070 --> 00:25:51,440
Alright. Come on.

605
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:53,100
Attention, all departments.

606
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,110
Lighting.

607
00:25:57,510 --> 00:25:59,000
Scene 3, Shot 3, Take 2.

608
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:00,790
Rolling.

609
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:10,160
Ah.

610
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:14,400
Look how beautiful I am in that mirror.

611
00:26:14,620 --> 00:26:15,250
But...

612
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:16,190
B-But...

613
00:26:17,350 --> 00:26:18,160
But I...

614
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,550
But I know

615
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:21,480
that's not the real me.

616
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:22,960
That's just...

617
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,030
That...

618
00:26:24,350 --> 00:26:25,400
What was it again?

619
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:26,680
Sorry, Director.

620
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:27,310
Okay, cut.

621
00:26:27,310 --> 00:26:28,550
That's just...

622
00:26:29,430 --> 00:26:30,510
You need to relax.

623
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:31,480
Don't be nervous.

624
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:32,830
Don't let all those words in the script

625
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:34,400
hold you back.

626
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:34,920
When the light hits you...

627
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:36,640
I think you were really good.

628
00:26:36,770 --> 00:26:38,530
Very, very good.

629
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:39,850
What do you guys think?

630
00:26:39,850 --> 00:26:41,250
Didn't she act adorably?

631
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:43,270
So adorable!

632
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:44,750
It's like this...

633
00:26:44,750 --> 00:26:45,200
I can't do this.

634
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:46,350
I really don't know how to act.

635
00:26:46,350 --> 00:26:47,640
How hard can it be?

636
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:49,310
Look at Mr. Big Shot.

637
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:52,200
What did He Manzhi ever see in him?

638
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:53,310
That's

639
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:55,680
what you call the power of capital.

640
00:26:56,110 --> 00:26:57,200
Got it, got it.

641
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,590
That's right!

642
00:26:59,590 --> 00:27:00,590
That's it!

643
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:01,750
This is exactly the state I want you in.

644
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:02,790
You're smiling.

645
00:27:03,310 --> 00:27:04,020
Don't move.

646
00:27:12,210 --> 00:27:14,140
Costume, makeup, and props teams.

647
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:17,400
Costume, makeup, and props teams!

648
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,590
Coming, coming!

649
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:22,920
I'm paying you all

650
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:24,960
because you're professionals.

651
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:27,160
If you don't put the auditioning actress

652
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,760
in the character's costume,

653
00:27:28,830 --> 00:27:30,310
give her the character's hairstyle,

654
00:27:30,310 --> 00:27:31,240
and put the character's jewelry on her,

655
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,920
how do you expect her

656
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:33,880
to get into the role?

657
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:35,880
Do you have any respect for the actress?

658
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:36,960
There he goes again.

659
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,350
Do you respect your profession

660
00:27:38,350 --> 00:27:40,310
and this stage?

661
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:41,680
Sorry, Mr. Tang.

662
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,640
What good is sorry?

663
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:43,480
Hurry up!

664
00:27:50,070 --> 00:27:50,880
Not good.

665
00:27:54,830 --> 00:27:55,350
This one.

666
00:27:55,350 --> 00:27:56,410
Alright, Mr. Tang.

667
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:03,640
Pick one you like.

668
00:28:20,310 --> 00:28:21,750
I think this one is nice.

669
00:28:21,850 --> 00:28:22,890
It suits me well.

670
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,160
Okay.

671
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:26,640
Here, let me help you.

672
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:31,880
Looks great on me.

673
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,560
When you put on this necklace,

674
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:36,040
you remind me of someone.

675
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:37,200
Who?

676
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,640
I'm sorry.

677
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:43,310
Mr. Tang,

678
00:28:43,750 --> 00:28:44,750
are you okay?

679
00:29:07,130 --> 00:29:08,320
Why doesn't she say anything?

680
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,920
She's a newcomer, after all.

681
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,830
Can she really do this?

682
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:20,610
What's going on?

683
00:29:41,770 --> 00:29:42,660
Look...

684
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,030
how beautiful I am

685
00:29:47,180 --> 00:29:48,420
in the mirror.

686
00:29:49,970 --> 00:29:51,420
But I know

687
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,160
this isn't the real me.

688
00:29:56,510 --> 00:29:58,880
It's only the me you want to see.

689
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:01,570
A movie star who is always smiling,

690
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,640
always graceful,

691
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:07,510
and always perfect.

692
00:30:10,430 --> 00:30:11,920
Sometimes,

693
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,640
I can't even tell...

694
00:30:18,110 --> 00:30:20,440
which one is the real me.

695
00:30:23,480 --> 00:30:25,240
Is it the glamorous me

696
00:30:26,750 --> 00:30:28,510
on the screen,

697
00:30:29,960 --> 00:30:32,310
or the me...

698
00:30:35,270 --> 00:30:36,200
crying secretly

699
00:30:36,790 --> 00:30:38,440
late at night?

700
00:30:39,030 --> 00:30:40,270
You all say

701
00:30:40,620 --> 00:30:43,420
I'm the most beautiful woman
in Republican China.

702
00:30:43,510 --> 00:30:45,030
But who knows

703
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,730
that even a beauty's tears...

704
00:30:51,110 --> 00:30:52,700
are bitter.

705
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:56,030
You love me for my beauty,

706
00:30:57,070 --> 00:30:58,920
but beauty is fleeting!

707
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:01,270
You chase after my fame,

708
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,920
but fame is nothing but an illusion.

709
00:31:04,740 --> 00:31:06,550
I've played so many roles,

710
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:08,830
yet I've never managed to play myself.

711
00:31:08,830 --> 00:31:10,480
I've fooled everyone,

712
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:12,240
yet

713
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:14,350
I can never fool my own heart.

714
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:17,640
The saddest thing in the world is

715
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:21,240
not even being able to tell for yourself

716
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:24,430
if you're acting

717
00:31:26,240 --> 00:31:27,750
or living.

718
00:31:32,150 --> 00:31:33,110
Perhaps...

719
00:31:37,070 --> 00:31:38,030
Perhaps...

720
00:31:38,830 --> 00:31:41,200
Perhaps I have long since become

721
00:31:41,920 --> 00:31:44,320
the most successful role I've ever played!

722
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,400
See that?

723
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,610
That's what you call
the most sincere performance!

724
00:32:11,610 --> 00:32:12,480
She's our lead actress.

725
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,740
No objections, right?

726
00:32:14,310 --> 00:32:15,070
Manyu,

727
00:32:15,070 --> 00:32:16,110
let's have dinner tonight

728
00:32:16,110 --> 00:32:16,960
to celebrate!

729
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:20,030
Manyu?

730
00:32:20,590 --> 00:32:21,240
Manyu.

731
00:32:25,110 --> 00:32:25,790
Manyu?

732
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:29,750
What's wrong?

733
00:32:29,750 --> 00:32:30,880
Still in character?

734
00:32:39,020 --> 00:32:39,910
Manyu.

735
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,200
Someone,

736
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,160
quick!

737
00:32:46,180 --> 00:32:47,240
The actress has collapsed!

738
00:32:47,240 --> 00:32:48,100
Who told you...

739
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:50,710
Take all these accessories off her!

740
00:33:08,350 --> 00:33:09,350
Why are you all...

741
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:12,730
Why are you all crowding around me?

742
00:33:13,440 --> 00:33:15,310
Why am I sitting on the floor, Mr. Tang?

743
00:33:15,310 --> 00:33:15,830
Come on,

744
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:16,720
help me up.

745
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:18,680
Just now, I was...

746
00:33:18,790 --> 00:33:20,720
Just now, I was standing here by myself,

747
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:22,510
and suddenly, my mind went blank.

748
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,040
Then I...

749
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,880
Then I blacked out.

750
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,310
What does she mean?

751
00:33:26,310 --> 00:33:27,440
Oh my God.

752
00:33:27,510 --> 00:33:29,160
Did you hear that?

753
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:30,830
Did you hear what she said?

754
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:32,510
That's what you call getting into it.

755
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:33,720
That's what you call being in character.

756
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,920
That's what you call becoming the role!

757
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:39,200
Many actors

758
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:41,730
never reach that state
in their entire lives.

759
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:42,550
Manyu,

760
00:33:44,030 --> 00:33:47,160
you're the most gifted girl
I've ever seen.

761
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:48,550
You have to be an actress.

762
00:33:48,550 --> 00:33:50,720
You're the future of cinema itself!

763
00:34:28,510 --> 00:34:29,360
Mr. Tang.

764
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:31,590
Are you crazy?

765
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:33,320
There's no overtime pay here.

766
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:35,000
I know, but didn't we audition
a whole bunch of people?

767
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:36,730
I think we should keep looking.

768
00:34:36,909 --> 00:34:39,230
What's there to consider?

769
00:34:39,590 --> 00:34:42,000
Isn't Miss Manyu already set
to play the role?

770
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,730
What else is there to consider?

771
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:46,500
Right, I was just about to
talk to you about that.

772
00:34:46,510 --> 00:34:49,000
I think this new girlfriend of yours

773
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:50,510
did quite well in the audition.

774
00:34:50,510 --> 00:34:51,230
Right?

775
00:34:51,320 --> 00:34:52,800
But she's a newcomer after all.

776
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:53,670
Do you know

777
00:34:54,070 --> 00:34:54,880
how many stars

778
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:56,400
want to be

779
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:58,190
in this film right now?

780
00:34:58,550 --> 00:34:59,190
I think

781
00:34:59,190 --> 00:35:01,360
it's still too risky to use a newcomer.

782
00:35:04,030 --> 00:35:05,840
I think you have a point.

783
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:08,630
Using a newcomer really is too risky.

784
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:10,110
And it just so happens

785
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:11,800
that many famous directors

786
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:13,840
have been calling me non-stop these days.

787
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:16,230
They say they're very sincere

788
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:18,400
and want to direct this movie.

789
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,800
Do you think I should consider them?

790
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,590
Have I wavered?

791
00:35:23,110 --> 00:35:23,920
Mr. Tang, let...

792
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,350
let me pour you a cup of coffee.

793
00:35:25,350 --> 00:35:26,620
I've quit coffee.

794
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,070
As for you,

795
00:35:29,150 --> 00:35:31,000
I understand that you artistic types
have your pursuits.

796
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:32,840
That's only natural.

797
00:35:33,510 --> 00:35:35,150
But don't forget

798
00:35:36,110 --> 00:35:37,320
who

799
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,550
art is supposed to serve.

800
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:43,360
Alright, it's fine.

801
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,840
Since I'm here,

802
00:35:45,190 --> 00:35:47,670
play Miss Manyu's audition footage

803
00:35:47,670 --> 00:35:49,070
from today again.

804
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:52,230
Put on Reel Six.

805
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:02,230
Scene 3, Shot 3, Take 3.

806
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:14,670
No, wait a minute.

807
00:36:14,960 --> 00:36:16,110
Run that again...

808
00:36:16,110 --> 00:36:17,770
Run that again from the start.

809
00:36:26,450 --> 00:36:27,570
Look.

810
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:29,480
This is what you call talent.

811
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,530
Something's wrong.

812
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:36,130
Did you forget to
clean the lens before playing it?

813
00:36:36,130 --> 00:36:37,930
Come on, play it again from here.

814
00:36:41,670 --> 00:36:42,510
Mr. Tang, look.

815
00:36:42,510 --> 00:36:43,440
What am I supposed to look at?

816
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:45,070
How can I see anything
with you standing there?

817
00:36:45,070 --> 00:36:46,360
You're not wearing your glasses,
so you can't see clearly.

818
00:36:46,360 --> 00:36:47,840
Come up here and look.

819
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:50,060
Right.

820
00:36:50,080 --> 00:36:50,920
Right, here.

821
00:36:51,350 --> 00:36:52,230
What's wrong?

822
00:36:52,790 --> 00:36:53,500
Look.

823
00:37:21,630 --> 00:37:22,960
You mean

824
00:37:23,330 --> 00:37:25,210
He Manzhi is back?

825
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:27,110
She never left.

826
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:30,030
Well, she has to go!

827
00:37:30,050 --> 00:37:32,180
Didn't you perform a ritual last time?

828
00:37:32,210 --> 00:37:34,920
I'd persuaded Ms. He
to let go of her resentment

829
00:37:35,030 --> 00:37:36,800
and move on to her next life soon.

830
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:38,550
And she'd agreed.

831
00:37:39,110 --> 00:37:41,110
But have you been talking about her again?

832
00:37:41,110 --> 00:37:43,000
If you don't let go of your attachment,

833
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:44,550
how can she let go?

834
00:37:45,230 --> 00:37:46,770
I didn't really talk about her much.

835
00:37:46,770 --> 00:37:48,760
Do you really think
I don't read the newspaper?

836
00:37:48,760 --> 00:37:49,840
The whole country knows

837
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,100
you're making a movie.

838
00:37:51,190 --> 00:37:52,920
Wouldn't the underworld know?

839
00:37:53,630 --> 00:37:55,280
After Ms. He's soul

840
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,400
became a vengeful ghost,

841
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:57,840
she had to attach herself

842
00:37:57,920 --> 00:37:59,150
to something she'd used in life

843
00:37:59,150 --> 00:38:01,210
in order to remain in the human world.

844
00:38:02,510 --> 00:38:05,030
Have you touched
any of her belongings lately?

845
00:38:05,030 --> 00:38:06,280
Think carefully.

846
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:09,150
Something she wore often
when she was alive.

847
00:38:09,150 --> 00:38:10,190
I think this one is quite nice.

848
00:38:10,190 --> 00:38:11,440
There's a lot of her aura on it.

849
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:13,630
Take all these accessories off her!

850
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,160
The necklace.

851
00:38:17,670 --> 00:38:19,590
I shouldn't have touched that necklace.

852
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:21,790
It was the one Manzhi loved to wear most.

853
00:38:21,880 --> 00:38:24,150
You must give me the necklace
as soon as possible

854
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,800
so I can perform a ritual
to suppress her spirit.

855
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:26,550
Otherwise,

856
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:27,880
Miss Manyu is

857
00:38:28,510 --> 00:38:30,800
very likely to be possessed by He Manzhi.

858
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,590
You mean,

859
00:38:33,190 --> 00:38:35,250
as long as Manyu wears that necklace,

860
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:36,670
she'll be...

861
00:38:37,960 --> 00:38:38,800
possessed?

862
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:42,170
Once the possession succeeds,

863
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:44,150
Miss Manyu's three souls and seven spirits

864
00:38:44,150 --> 00:38:45,230
will be scattered,

865
00:38:45,250 --> 00:38:47,040
and she can never be saved.

866
00:38:47,710 --> 00:38:48,550
Remember,

867
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,360
never let Miss Manyu

868
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,550
touch that necklace again.

869
00:38:51,550 --> 00:38:52,710
But I did it with her.

870
00:38:52,710 --> 00:38:54,110
Am I in danger?

871
00:38:54,330 --> 00:38:55,390
You did what with her?

872
00:38:55,390 --> 00:38:55,840
I...

873
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:58,510
just...

874
00:38:58,630 --> 00:39:01,360
Just some simple physical contact.

875
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:03,630
You're in danger now.

876
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,510
Remember,

877
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:07,030
do not go near Miss Manyu again.

878
00:39:07,030 --> 00:39:08,360
Or you'll be tainted by the resentment

879
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:10,000
and end up torn to pieces!

880
00:39:12,590 --> 00:39:13,710
But...

881
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:15,280
You saw it that day too.

882
00:39:15,480 --> 00:39:17,880
With all those reporters there,
I already put it out there.

883
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:21,590
I have to see Manyu again.

884
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:25,070
Do you really have to make this movie?

885
00:39:25,360 --> 00:39:26,630
I have to.

886
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:29,190
This is my last chance.

887
00:39:30,190 --> 00:39:31,190
That necklace...

888
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:34,510
Possession.

889
00:39:39,190 --> 00:39:39,840
Master.

890
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,150
I have an idea.

891
00:39:50,110 --> 00:39:51,360
Miss Jiang,

892
00:39:51,550 --> 00:39:53,030
what's that in your hand?

893
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,190
A script.

894
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:58,190
Tang Yushan's ending.

895
00:39:58,800 --> 00:39:59,960
You guessed right.

896
00:40:00,150 --> 00:40:01,670
This isn't over yet.

897
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:04,280
Tang Yushan will come
looking for me again.

898
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:06,230
The first time I met that man,

899
00:40:06,480 --> 00:40:08,480
I knew exactly what kind of person he was.

900
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:09,760
Incredibly greedy.

901
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,590
After He Manzhi died,

902
00:40:11,880 --> 00:40:13,400
he got himself into even more debt.

903
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:14,760
So he definitely won't

904
00:40:15,070 --> 00:40:17,270
let this opportunity slip by this time.

905
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:18,510
Master,

906
00:40:18,710 --> 00:40:19,960
this is a donation

907
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:21,430
I've prepared for your Yunhe Temple.

908
00:40:21,430 --> 00:40:23,240
Please accept it.

909
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:26,550
Of course, I also have
a presumptuous request.

910
00:40:26,550 --> 00:40:27,710
To be exact,

911
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:29,920
only you can help me with it.

912
00:40:30,150 --> 00:40:32,110
I want everyone to witness

913
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:33,880
He Manzhi's return.

914
00:40:34,110 --> 00:40:36,030
You want me to summon her soul?

915
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:37,390
It shouldn't be hard, right?

916
00:40:37,390 --> 00:40:40,280
Tang Yushan will come to you again
to summon her soul,

917
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:42,230
because he's seen you perform
that paper effigy ritual

918
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:44,950
and knows you have the real skills
to protect him.

919
00:40:44,950 --> 00:40:45,800
So?

920
00:40:45,820 --> 00:40:47,900
So play it cool

921
00:40:48,180 --> 00:40:49,040
and ignore him.

922
00:40:49,040 --> 00:40:50,040
Movies

923
00:40:50,060 --> 00:40:52,540
sell spectacle and dreams.

924
00:40:52,570 --> 00:40:53,220
Alright.

925
00:40:53,790 --> 00:40:55,910
Let's hold a press conference

926
00:40:56,190 --> 00:40:58,510
and announce a film

927
00:40:58,510 --> 00:40:59,760
starring a ghost.

928
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,000
Won't the public be curious?

929
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:01,960
Won't they be surprised?

930
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:03,670
Won't it sell tickets?

931
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:05,480
This movie is bound to be a hit.

932
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:07,070
That's a brilliant idea.

933
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:08,920
It really is a selling point.

934
00:41:09,030 --> 00:41:10,360
Even Hollywood

935
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:12,280
hasn't come up with a stunt

936
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,480
like using a ghost in a movie.

937
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:14,190
Master,

938
00:41:14,320 --> 00:41:15,510
you heard him, right?

939
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:17,240
Not even Hollywood has done it.

940
00:41:17,280 --> 00:41:18,510
The future of cinema

941
00:41:18,510 --> 00:41:19,840
is counting on you.

942
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:21,630
I...

943
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:25,000
can't do this.

944
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:26,880
Even if he begs,

945
00:41:26,970 --> 00:41:28,330
you can't agree immediately.

946
00:41:28,330 --> 00:41:29,040
Of course,

947
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:31,030
money can't sway me.

948
00:41:31,290 --> 00:41:32,890
But enough money

949
00:41:33,630 --> 00:41:35,320
can.

950
00:41:36,260 --> 00:41:37,960
Body possession is no small matter.

951
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:40,460
Miss Manyu has been
possessed several times.

952
00:41:40,460 --> 00:41:42,280
She could drop dead at any moment.

953
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:43,630
As a Taoist,

954
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:46,630
if I let some innocent girl
lose her life for no reason,

955
00:41:47,320 --> 00:41:48,920
it'd damage my cultivation.

956
00:41:49,190 --> 00:41:50,630
We can compensate for

957
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,000
all the harm done to everyone.

958
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:54,590
If she dies, how can the film be made?

959
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,670
Wouldn't the whole project fall apart?

960
00:41:56,670 --> 00:41:57,630
I think

961
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:59,840
we should discuss it carefully.

962
00:42:00,110 --> 00:42:01,280
You can't

963
00:42:01,440 --> 00:42:04,170
go to any lengths
just to make money, right, Tang?

964
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:05,280
Nonsense!

965
00:42:05,550 --> 00:42:07,360
Who said I'm doing this
for freaking money?

966
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,650
Have I ever cared about money?

967
00:42:08,650 --> 00:42:10,050
Even if you refuse him,

968
00:42:10,170 --> 00:42:11,900
he definitely won't let you go.

969
00:42:12,190 --> 00:42:13,800
Because Tang Yushan is determined

970
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:15,880
to make a fortune off the dead this time.

971
00:42:15,880 --> 00:42:16,710
Of course.

972
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:19,590
He'll definitely use love as an excuse,

973
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:21,760
telling you everything he does

974
00:42:22,110 --> 00:42:23,320
is for love.

975
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:25,150
Master, now I'm asking you

976
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:27,030
to reunite my wife and me

977
00:42:27,030 --> 00:42:28,670
in another way.

978
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:31,000
Wouldn't that be a good deed on your part?

979
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:32,590
It's not entirely impossible.

980
00:42:32,590 --> 00:42:33,360
However,

981
00:42:33,510 --> 00:42:35,320
the ritual isn't that simple.

982
00:42:36,110 --> 00:42:37,440
It'll have to be double.

983
00:42:38,190 --> 00:42:39,030
Understood.

984
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:40,480
Double the effort.

985
00:42:41,670 --> 00:42:43,030
I have something else to take care of.

986
00:42:43,030 --> 00:42:43,800
I'll take my leave.

987
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:45,510
Hearing that the investment
needs to be doubled,

988
00:42:45,510 --> 00:42:47,150
some investors will surely pull out.

989
00:42:47,150 --> 00:42:48,380
What if he wants to pull out too?

990
00:42:48,380 --> 00:42:48,970
See you.

991
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:49,930
What then?

992
00:42:49,950 --> 00:42:51,380
Talk to him about gambling.

993
00:42:51,380 --> 00:42:53,510
That's the only thing
he truly understands.

994
00:42:53,510 --> 00:42:55,910
Actually, playing cards is just like life.

995
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,860
Most of the time,
you're just drawing from the deck.

996
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:00,800
Whether you win or lose in the end

997
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:02,670
comes down to those one or two big hands.

998
00:43:02,670 --> 00:43:03,360
Master,

999
00:43:03,590 --> 00:43:04,480
then please

1000
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:06,890
help us read the fortune of this movie.

1001
00:43:07,070 --> 00:43:08,360
Now Tang Yushan

1002
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:10,880
is facing
the most important card game of his life.

1003
00:43:10,880 --> 00:43:14,110
He needs someone by his side
to make him go all in.

1004
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,550
Spring thunder has rolled in.

1005
00:43:15,550 --> 00:43:16,760
After the three signs of Jingzhe,

1006
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:18,960
new shoots will break through the soil.

1007
00:43:19,070 --> 00:43:20,200
What does that mean?

1008
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:23,760
Do you play cards often?

1009
00:43:24,360 --> 00:43:25,710
You've played

1010
00:43:25,710 --> 00:43:27,840
your share of card games, big and small.

1011
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:28,920
This time,

1012
00:43:29,550 --> 00:43:30,710
what you're holding

1013
00:43:31,230 --> 00:43:32,800
is a strong hand.

1014
00:43:35,880 --> 00:43:37,050
You're absolutely right.

1015
00:43:37,050 --> 00:43:38,370
I've had my share of wins and losses,

1016
00:43:38,370 --> 00:43:41,630
but I've always felt like
I was just one hand away from the big win.

1017
00:43:41,630 --> 00:43:42,960
I can feel it.

1018
00:43:43,280 --> 00:43:44,670
This time, I've drawn the big hand

1019
00:43:44,670 --> 00:43:47,070
that can change my fate.

1020
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:48,840
No one can talk me out of it.

1021
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:50,510
Even if I have to borrow from loan sharks,

1022
00:43:50,510 --> 00:43:52,320
I'm making this movie!

1023
00:43:53,800 --> 00:43:54,920
I'm going all in.

1024
00:43:58,100 --> 00:44:00,330
[In the next episode]

1025
00:44:00,400 --> 00:44:01,150
Where there's a female ghost,

1026
00:44:01,150 --> 00:44:02,840
there has to be a Taoist sorcerer.

1027
00:44:02,840 --> 00:44:04,690
But has anyone ever thought about

1028
00:44:04,690 --> 00:44:06,030
the possibility that this sorcerer

1029
00:44:06,030 --> 00:44:08,030
is in cahoots with the female ghost?

1030
00:44:09,110 --> 00:44:10,630
Everyone, out.

1031
00:44:10,800 --> 00:44:12,880
I need to help her quickly understand

1032
00:44:13,070 --> 00:44:15,050
what the character was feeling
at the time.

1033
00:44:15,050 --> 00:44:16,380
Let me tell you a secret.

1034
00:44:16,410 --> 00:44:17,850
Have you ever thought

1035
00:44:18,080 --> 00:44:19,920
that He Manzhi
might not have killed herself?

1036
00:44:19,920 --> 00:44:20,880
Let go of me.

1037
00:44:20,900 --> 00:44:21,940
Smile.

1038
00:44:22,320 --> 00:44:24,680
Smile, and I'll let you
walk out of that door alive.
